Base SHA (merge-base with origin/main): 02a44baa2dcaa5b916e0168f344625059b146749

Scope of change
---------------
- New feature module src/features/admin/reconciliation: types, api, queries
  (reconciliationKeys), schemas, error messages, AdminReconciliation component
  and AdjustAnomalyDialog.
- Endpoints: POST /api/admin/reconciliation/run?mode=quick|full,
  GET /api/admin/reconciliation/reports?page&limit,
  GET /api/admin/reconciliation/reports/:id,
  POST /api/admin/reconciliation/anomalies/:id/adjust.
- AdminReconciliationPage reduced to a 7-line thin page.
- 4-state report list (loading/error/empty/success), report detail, 4 anomaly
  types + default label for unknown types, isBalanced badges, BigInt balance
  difference, paginated history.
- Adjustment amount is a positive integer STRING validated by regex + BigInt
  (max 18 digits); reason 5..500 chars; submit locked while pending.
- 409 ALREADY_ADJUSTED refreshes data and explains; 503 ADJUST_OUTCOME_UNKNOWN
  shows "chưa rõ kết quả" + manual reload and never auto-retries.
- No Idempotency-Key header is sent because the real route does not accept one;
  the backend derives a fixed referenceId per anomaly. Documented as a
  deliberate deviation in docs/handover/admin.md and CONTRACT_OPEN_QUESTIONS.md.
- AGENTS.md 6.6 conflict (hide adjustment button vs N18) documented; the
  implementation follows the Week-4 plan and awaits Đạt's confirmation.

